    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Add a `coverage_floor` check: the test command must produce a coverage report with at least 80%. Decide which artifact carries the floor.\n2. Support a `--strict` mode that promotes every `warn` to `block`. Document the cases where strict mode is the right default.\n3. Make the gate produce a Markdown summary in addition to JSON. Defend which fields belong in the summary.\n4. Add a `time_since_last_human_touch` check: any file edited within 60 seconds of a human keystroke is exempt from off-scope flags.\n5. Run the gate on a real agent diff from your product. How many findings are real and how many are noise? Where does the gate need to grow?"
      ]
    }
